{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/20237-and-the-games-begin-demon-pbp-discussion","id":20237,"title":"And the Games Begin... - Demon PbP Discussion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-29T10:22:48-08:00","id":20237,"title":"And the Games Begin... - Demon PbP Discussion","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> I will be running a PbP for Squidheadjax and Calrabjohns, this is a 2 player game with the intention of exploring some of the themes of the game.<br /> <br /> I have, amazingly enough, no experience with D:tD prior to this but we'll muddle through somehow <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> This thread is for general OOC discussion, anyone can post so if you're not playing and are just interested in watching the madness then do feel free to comment!<br /> <br /> Squid, Cal if you could begin making characters that would be great. Do please bear in mind the 'pitch' below though.<br /> <br /> I want to run the game to explore Demon as hunter and Demon as hunted. To that end I would like one of you two to take on the role of newly fallen (as in the very first scene you're in will be you falling) and for the other to be a relatively new (maybe 5 bonus xp to start?) but already fallen Demon. The newly fallen will know Angels are after them in a general sense (because falling isn't exactly a stealthy affair) while the other player will sense <i>something</i> God Machine related and have suspicions that it's another Angel falling.<br /> <br /> A bit of cat and mouse hopefully but eventually I'd hope you'd meet up and see how your experiences through the game at that point flavour your meeting.<br /> <br /> To that end please begin the character building process! Do try and decide which role you'd like to take on, newly fallen or barely established. Consider the following.<br /> <br /> 1. You will be in the UK, Nov 30th, 2013 at the start of the game.<br /> 2. You will be in some generic mid sized town/small city somewhere in the south of the country, but specifics don't really matter.<br /> 3. Integrators are a'Ok but one whose immediate goals are to get right back into the GM will be vetoed...not likely to work very well unless you've got something compelling to sell me on it.<br /> 4. For your Covers if you could please describe them in 100 words or less that would be great.<br /> 5. We'll be using the rules document from the KickStarter (obviously).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T18:46:46-08:00","id":20456,"title":"","content":"Are PbPs within the board etiquette, or should we find somewhere else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T20:45:32-08:00","id":20485,"title":"","content":"I don't think it would support the actual PbP for the dice-rolling purposes. I assumed we were planning it here and moving to some place like rpol.net Unless it's against policies though, there'd be no reason the posts couldn't be transcribed here at the end of each scene or however it breaks up. Wouldn't it just be similar to a game breakdown like Baron Samedi has posted in the past about his Geist sessions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":257,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","user":"Calrabjohns","date":". 11-29-2013, 11:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T00:24:49-08:00","id":20531,"title":"","content":"Setting this up as an Actual Play, yeah, that could be neat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T00:49:55-08:00","id":20538,"title":"","content":"Meh.<br /> <br /> I was just going to run it here, no fiddling around with other forums or cross posting in multiple locations.<br /> <br /> Dice rolling...again meh. Use Invisible castle or your preferred one and link the results in your post. Or just roll analog and post the results. What matters is the narrative and the decisions you make, the powers you use, the conversations you have etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T01:59:44-08:00","id":20552,"title":"","content":"I have no preference. All of that sounds great to me. Happy as a clam now that I know how to post here without a word traffic jam ensuing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T07:23:24-08:00","id":20627,"title":"","content":"How much time would you say has passed as a barely fallen Demon. 1 year or less? I don't think it would be more than 3 but want to make sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T07:40:37-08:00","id":20632,"title":"","content":"Ok, works for me. Still busy with American Thanksgiving Weekend stuff tho, so can't post much today. As I mull over the idea I'm coming up with, I realize it can work for either the brand-new demon or the one with longer tenure, but I'm actually starting to lean toward the latter - which one do you want, Calrabjohns?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T09:26:06-08:00","id":20666,"title":"","content":"Couple of months for the barely fallen. Enough to have gotten vaguely comfortable with their current situation.<br /> <br /> Not enough to have met a lot of other Demons or Angel or gotten too many attachments to Agencies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T17:39:16-08:00","id":20883,"title":"","content":"I had been leaning toward the already fallen but if needed, he can be adjusted for Houston, we have a problem.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I'm still working at it as a competing idea came about earlier today for a psychologist who uses his sessions with patients to figure out which life would be best to appropriate. People seem to get much better around him for some reason but then it wears off and they want that feeling back.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I have no idea why he Fell though or why he would have been placed to do what he does in the first place---maybe as a Messenger to build up the wavering confidence of a member in the House of Parliament (or Lords---my ignorance is showing) and to sway him toward voting a certain way for a zoning bill to the ends of ground for Infrastructure.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Maybe it would be better to figure out who's Falling and who Fell on Sunday? One story might end up being more conducive for a good setup than the other in this case for each relative position. As I was typing this, the idea of the psychologist having fallen mid-examination popped in and that really tickles me.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I think I can still get one of them in tonight but it would be later. Is there anything more you can think of that you want from us, Scutarri? From the concise rundown you asked for regarding covers, I'm not sure if you'd like the same for each question like &quot;Who thinks he/she knows something about you that is smoke and mirrors?,&quot; or if there are things you'd like to leave blank and fill in as the story progresses.</div>I'll be right back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T00:22:56-08:00","id":21033,"title":"","content":"Consider the 100 word limit for Covers to be more a warning about not going into too much detail or writing too much. Feel free to answer the bullet point questions for the Covers if you want to, but some of that can emerge through play.<br /> <br /> The psychologist could be the newly fallen then. Sent as a messenger to influence a Member of Parliament. The MP is in charge of whichever constituency the city is in and has their home/surgery in the same city. The Psychologist falls for an as yet undetermined reason. The Fence is set up in the same city but has been active as a Demon for a few months and suddenly feels something big happening...<br /> <br /> One thing from a structure side when we play.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Can you use spoiler blocks for your scenes and try to not read each others? Hopefully it'll obfuscate at least a little of what each other are doing until you've met up. If it doesn't work in play we'll drop it as a gimmick.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T05:22:31-08:00","id":21122,"title":"","content":"That sounds ok to me. Sorry for the confusion though re: the psychologist vs. fence. It would only be one of those either having fallen or barely established. I didn't realize how murky that read.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I'll keep getting to it then.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T08:45:53-08:00","id":21169,"title":"","content":"And I'm done with holiday sorts of things! So, my idea for the newly-Fallen:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Miss Greene:</b></span><br /> A Guardian, sent to preserve Infrastructure concealed by a large, largely wooded, municipal park, and most specifically an abstract, vaguely man-shaped, rusted iron statue of indeterminate but 'old' age. In the cover of a young woman with a surprising amount of resources to toss into activism, it protects the park and its original design until the statue \u2013 actually a Destroyer cut off from its original supporting Infrastructure and protectively encased in a mundane disguise \u2013 awakens and goes on a rampage. Having come to genuinely care for the whole town, it violates its directives and sneak-attacks the Destroyer to stop it.<br /> <br /> While still mostly concerned with ducking Angelic attention, Miss Greene is trying to establish herself as more of a broad-focused background supporter of causes that improve quality of life for the people in the town. She\u2019s starting to fancy herself a bit of a nature goddess and is starting to establish a cult to act as extra lookouts for her and, later, to increase her influence. Her focus on humanity and acting through them pretty much settles her in as a Tempter, once she actually comes to know the Agendas at least.<br /> <br /> ...and that's about 200 words, but I'm terrible at summaries.<br /> Some bullet point details will follow later today, and I'll get to work on a character sheet if you like it, ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1096,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","user":"squidheadjax","date":". 12-01-2013, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T01:48:34-08:00","id":21492,"title":"","content":"Squid that's a fully workable concept.<br /> <br /> But perhaps may work better as the recently fallen rather than the one that fals at the start of the game. They sound like they've got links and such built into the world already which a newly fallen probably would not have.<br /> <br /> Are you happy to be the slightly established Demon with that character concept? If so you make a normal starting character and get +5xp to make them with. (5 is probably a lot but I figure the Demon does the most learning and gains the most experience right when they start as everything is new to them so everything is a learning experience).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T07:43:34-08:00","id":21616,"title":"","content":"Good point. I'll work on it after work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T09:44:42-08:00","id":21713,"title":"","content":"First off, I'm sorry that I did not submit in the time that I thought I could. This is a character that has been bubbling in my noggin since reading the various playtests and the KS document, which made me think I'd be able to deliver it quick. Not so much.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">It took reading your char., Squid, and using your answers to all questions Scutarri, to make any head-way. At first it came out as a story. That felt too long and I don't think it would have been clear enough. Then I retooled it to be more like your writeup Squid (in form only). It's clearer in some ways (some not so much) but I didn't make headway with length. All of this is to explain why it's enclosed in spoiler tags as I have no concern for privacy with this one. It just would have sprawled otherwise. On the plus side, the character is firmly in the newly fallen category now.</div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><i>Mr. Sweep (aka Mr. ?) aka Mr. Fence</i>- A Psychopomp<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Initially tasked to work at the shipping yard as a janitor, Mr. Sweep was a bare patch job. He knew the layout of the pier and had cursory relationships written in but mostly with the night shift manager, Reginald Barnes. A cargo freighter was meant to arrive within the night or early morning and enclosed in a large crate was an item for building Infrastructure in the region, ostensibly a coded blueprint packed behind the frame of a painting.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The ship never arrived due to raging storms though and it diverted course to a new port, delaying by a week. Compounding the delay was a new inventory by customs, which tipped off the Marzini syndicate. Word came and Mr. Sweep found himself given an impromptu field promotion to try and bring things back on course.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The name changed to Tommy Facilli (now known as Mr. Fence) but the rest of the patch job was incorporated into a utility man in the employ of the Marzinis---forgery, reallocation of purloined items and other things. This was to ensure retrieval but also hopefully establish a line to the family for future use.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">However, the night of the freighter arriving took a different turn. Two members of an Insurgent Agency came from one of the crates. Mr. Fence's handler (Mr. Wrecker) leapt out of the cradle seat of a wrecking ball. Fence would have joined in but for a complete shutdown. New orders had come down in light of the bedlam. Observe and then collect the eyes and *?* of all combatants, angel or demon, for transport to a repurposing facility.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Mr. Wrecker dispatched one of the demons before he had time to break out but the other broke skin and wrapped his body to bind Wrecker. Wrecker turned his head facing backwards with a large pillar of light gathering in his slacked jaw. Instant immolation for both.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">As the light reached its peak, Mr. Fence felt himself free to act and moved under its glare to try and finish this covertly. He wavered on the last set of eyes and in that moment of weakness fell. Those eyes glowed red and coils shot out, piercing Fence's skin and flooding his veins.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">He barely stumbled out of the shipping yard as the burst of light faded and gave way to morning. The aberrant eyes had given him something but it took far more. It might have taken any meaningful headstart.</div></div></div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The &quot;story&quot; version follows below because it elaborates on the &quot;eyes,&quot; what they (may have) illuminated and what they've obscured. There's a different tone to how harried he is there too.</div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Mr. Sweep (aka Mr. ?) aka Mr. Fence:<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The job is <span style=\"color:gray\">(was meant to be)</span> simple: there is <span style=\"color:gray\">(was---will be?)</span> an incoming shipment and in that shipment there was an item to be secured. All the available information suggests it will <span style=\"color:gray\">(err@r)</span> take one night. The patch of a janitor will suffice, Unit Yesod. Your name is Timothy Vasilli. Specs for the shipping yard and tertiary relationship with night shift manager Reginald Barnes are inbound.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Inclement weather has disrupted delivery. Difficulty has compounded as the shipping manifest has changed. The item you're meant to obtain was examined by customs and repackaged in a new container. The container also houses various stolen goods expected by the Marzini syndicate. *redacted<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Direct action is not an option. Their association may become a liquid acquisition in the future.</div></div> </div> </div>redacted*</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Your new name is Tommy Facilli, a utility man for the Marzinis. Specs and tertiary relationship with Reginald remain intact but your previous position is untenable for optimal retrieval of the item without repurposing. You are now their inside man. Keep the prospective plans in mind. The container is a week out.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The ship has docked and the manifest has been logged. Cargo crate number is A#\u00f7\u00a3#&amp;##@\u00d734#&amp;\u00f7\u00a3-??-UK <span style=\"color:gray\">(what was tha---gah it burns!)...</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">...remain still and then retri...repeat. Do not assist.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Acquisition target diverted. Priority one is clean up of renegade skirmish. Melt down everything but the eyes and \u00d7\u00d7#\u00f7\u00a3+an--@s. Secure those and prepare for reclamation. ??? of aberration and Unit Binah received. Commence with the eyes. Binah eyes received. ....</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Unit Yesod, send the heretic eyes. Unit Yesod. ... Tommy. Tim.. <span style=\"color:gray\">(pennies on my tongue\u00bf---tendrils <b>draggi</b>ng me into sand---please)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><i>(We don't have much time, assuming you remember this bit at all. First though...I'm sorry. Wrong place and all that.)</i></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:gray\">(I can't feel anything.)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><i>(Admitting a problem is the first step to recovery. Christ, bad habit. No time. Look, you're unplugged. Sure you would have figured that out but I think I'm about to cease to be or buried verrrry deep. Tried to salvage a fiasco and I think you helped me hitch a ride back to the factory. Well, half of me anyhow. You get one question but---)</i></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:gray\">(No, I want everything before turning myself in you bastard and you're gonna give it to me.)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><i>(Anger and degenerative language. Good sign you're acclimating but you've sped up this little t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate. Lucky if you get the one query. All of this will be registering as text. The Plug can just feed you the skinny on the instant but the best I could do is a wordy by-blow. Everything enclosed in parentheticals is going to fade but if you can focus---I got one thing out for you, imperfectly filtered unfortunately and when you snap out of this your heart might just stop anyway. You have to figure it out later though assuming that doesn't happen. We're outof time.)</i></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:gray\">(What about my heart now?! Wait a minute!)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><i>(No. No more time. You've been frozen in a very flawed bolthole for what I can only guess is thirty seconds. Probably more. You're standing right in the rubble of an angel and a demon in reality. Your heart will beat fast when you leave here---consciousness and your imprint will smack into you like a rubber band snap. Name. Try to---urrrrrghhaa---remember---your name. And one other thing.)</i></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Everything feels sharp. My heart---it <u>is</u> beating fast. Too fast. Body feels so heavy and the left leg has a kink where Joey Scalaizi smacked it with a golf club. Ok, remember my name. Well that's easy. Tommy Facilli. So what's the other thing then.</div><span style=\"color:red\">Run.</span></div></div> </div> </div> I'll be back around 8-9 p.m. EST. but if I can swing earlier I will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T11:05:02-08:00","id":21771,"title":"","content":"So your soon to be demon grabbed a piece of one of the demons in the free for all and got a piece of their mind? (Literal and figurative)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1096,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","user":"squidheadjax","date":". 12-02-2013, 02:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T19:57:10-08:00","id":22077,"title":"","content":"Not exactly. His original purpose was to ensure a piece of (or plan for) Infrastructure wasn't taken and to relocate it. When the fight ensued, the priority changed. It was more important for him to make sure that angel parts didn't fall into enemy hands and to take back demon remains to make sure no intelligence would transmit back to whatever Agents were left.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Once he transported the remains via teleportation (or Plasma Drive with another read), the piece or plan for Infrastructure would follow. After that, he would have been wiped and repurposed.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The &quot;reason&quot; he Fell is because he took one moment to reflect on a pair of eyes rather than sending them up with the ?s (whatever could be considered the core of an angel or demon---the God Machine wouldn't trust anyone with a name for it, it would only express that it needs to be salvaged). The <u>eyes grabbed him</u> to make him Fall as a last strike at the enemy.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">On paper, it's a point in Terrible Form and the Multiple Agendas merit. Since he's newly fallen though, the MAs would only factor once he knows what Agendas are to begin with.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Does that make sense or is it still very fiddly.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T20:29:11-08:00","id":22092,"title":"","content":"That's awesome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T21:27:26-08:00","id":22108,"title":"","content":"Thank you so much. This will be my first real game and I want to start off right <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T23:46:41-08:00","id":22162,"title":"","content":"All sounds perfectly sound.<br /> <br /> I would note that I don't plan to run this in the long term so you may find the Multiple Agendas Merit won't come up, so you could keep that background and purchase the Merit if/when the story reaches that point rather than start with it and maybe not get to use it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T01:02:19-08:00","id":22187,"title":"","content":"Sounds good to me. I'll finish up the rest then.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Small suggestion: Since demons speak multiple languages, maybe we should agree on a few colors to code each one. Red for Italian. Blue for Russian. Purple for Urdu or a language unlikely to be used and/or is obscure. </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> For however long you feel like running this, thank you. </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T07:30:21-08:00","id":22327,"title":"","content":"Argh, my computer suffered from a slight case of death last night and I can't do sheet work on my cramped smartphone very well. Hopefully I can resurrect it tonight. As for colors, let's code each language if and when it becomes relevant to a listener who isn't a Demon. Being omnilingual, demons can code-switch at the end of every sentence if they wanted to.and no Demon would have trouble keeping up. Also, Android is apparently allergic to paragraphs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1096,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","user":"squidheadjax","date":". 12-03-2013, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T08:54:37-08:00","id":22369,"title":"","content":"Sure.<br /> <br /> If you want to colourcode different languages when relevant then feel free, but only do it when needed rather than trying to make a list in advance <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T23:51:39-08:00","id":23573,"title":"","content":"Right.<br /> <br /> It looks like we've got:<br /> <br /> Squidhead: Ms. Greene, the ALREADY fallen demon, coming along as a character sheet already<br /> Calrabjohns: A psychologist or a fence who will FALL AT THE START of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T07:08:13-08:00","id":24343,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Due to Fence briefly being Russian and then shifted to Italian, I figured those languages would come up naturally for him. Didn't mean to presume beyond that. Color code as we go makes more sense.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Squid, I have the same problems. I pretty much exclusively use my Galaxy Note 2. For paragraphing, I indent each time I need a break and that makes it split up. If you ever want to post and aren't near a computer, that's a good workaround.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Definitely a fence. The psychologist is for another day. I'm done except for tiny details that I need to ask you about. Sending the char. sheet now.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I needed to reformat it. It was very messy and editing is long on phone. Now it should really be done.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":257,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","user":"Calrabjohns","date":".  The White Rabbit from Alice in Wonderland 12-06-2013, 12:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T16:00:20-08:00","id":24714,"title":"","content":"I still have to figure out which embeds/exploits to take, but that's pretty much it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T18:11:29-08:00","id":24802,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Figuring those out took me a little while and Demonic Form too. There's too much cool stuff to pick from dang it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T23:47:37-08:00","id":24961,"title":"","content":"Well you should have a bit of time to make the final tweaks.<br /> <br /> I'm going to be away from the internet for the weekend so will be able to reply again on Monday 9th.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T23:53:51-08:00","id":24966,"title":"","content":"My birthday is on the 9th so I'll be out that day. All's a go after that though for me barring a meteor crashing into the earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T23:53:55-08:00","id":26340,"title":"","content":"Ok you two can you please finalise (last chance for big changes!) and send me your characters and we should hopefully be able to start early this week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T08:20:09-08:00","id":27205,"title":"","content":"Sent you what I think should be the finishing bits. Think I'm good but I'll look it over in the interim to make sure I didn't miss anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T09:24:56-08:00","id":27255,"title":"","content":"The gdoc link I sent you is still good and it should be done pretty much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T11:25:19-08:00","id":28133,"title":"","content":"Alrighty.<br /> <br /> Let's do this!<br /> <br /> Game thread is here<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28126-the-heat-is-on-ic-game-thread\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28126-the-heat-is-on-ic-game-thread\"> The Heat is....ON! - IC Game Thread - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28126-the-heat-is-on-ic-game-thread\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28126-the-heat-is-on-ic-game-thread </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1-mU-YSk32I This is the IC thread for the Demon PbP. Calrabjohns and Squidheadjax are the players and I am GM. One player is newly fallen (first scene in fact) and the other will be hunting them down trying to find out what's happening. To keep some semblance of mystery the </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Can the player who will be falling at the start of the game please make the first post in that thread.<br /> <br /> The scene will be you falling and as that's an important personal event I want you to describe that scene, who's there, what's happening and what your fall really is like.<br /> <br /> I'll pick up from there.<br /> <br /> Main rules for the scene are 1. it must be within the city, 2. the description must make some mention of some kind of surge in aetheric energy or some such, something for the other player to latch onto with Unseen Sense (Godmachine) or similar to give them a hint of where to go and pique their interest.<br /> <br /> Also, please can you BOTH make your posts primarily with [spoiler] tags, to add some semblance of mystery so the pursuer has limited knowledge of what they find and the pursued has little idea of who is following etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T17:06:52-08:00","id":28398,"title":"","content":"let's light this candle!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T08:50:44-08:00","id":28752,"title":"","content":"I think it's safe to say it's lit. I didn't enclose the beginning part but I don't think that will be a problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T14:39:10-08:00","id":28937,"title":"","content":"Working on a reply but I have to head off for a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T16:50:08-08:00","id":29002,"title":"","content":"Black, black, black... eh, let's run with the spy movie cliches. My imagination isn't in a colorful mood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T19:43:29-08:00","id":29100,"title":"","content":"What are we calling the city?<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I liked what I could read <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T00:37:42-08:00","id":29191,"title":"","content":"Well we're in southern England somewhere with a port (apparently <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )...I'm gonna go for Portsmouth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/