2, Res 2, Com 3. I can always change those in later scenes if they become actually important <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I do it this way because I find that PbPs have a extremely high mortality rate. There's the explosion of activity early on, posts every day but over time people drift away. It's a natural tendency for them. I'm trying to avoid us getting bogged down in mother may I asking about dice rolls (we have a post rate of about 1 per day...imagine trying to discuss a dice pool and mods at that rate!).<br /> <br /> It also doesn't help that I'm outright failing on all my dice rolls anyway! What, notice someone with floating swarm bodies and vines growing through their hair? Nonsense, nothing to see here!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T16:57:09-08:00","id":32833,"title":"","content":"Doesn't help that I keep rolling <i>ridiculously </i>on <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php</a> .<br /> Maybe I should scrounge up some physical dice, those usually like me less.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]