m:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">There is one mortal who is currently unaccounted for from the opening scene. It was Vinny the enforcer. He never trusted Tommy and watched him that night through night vision goggles. At that moment, one of the insurgent demons set off a magnesium flare amplified by the core going boom too. All those elements combined to make the perfect storm of shit luck for Vinny.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> If you want to use him down the line as someone who could compromise Tommy on a less severe level than Mr. Violet, maybe one eye could be burned out with the other in recovery. Or he could become a vengeful mafia Zatoichi.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> The handler angel is also wondering most likely what happened to his operatives and why have the files been absconded with.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> And then there's the potential to have a member of Jack's ring or Agency, if there is such a group, wanting to retrieve the item from the pier.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> But in short: Definite mafia guy with some retinal injuries if not brain death. Possible angel wanting answers and less possible demon too. </div></div></div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> I'll endeavor to be quicker with the whole enchilada.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T11:32:19-08:00","id":34526,"title":"","content":"<b>Cal</b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Can I get the details about the Goya painting?</div></div> </div> </div>","signa